# sway, desktop profile (ocean). Included from config/sway/config through
# ~/.config/sway/profile, a symlink apply.sh points at this file or at ./laptop.
# The lock (swayidle) and the waybar launch stay in the shared config.
#
# No kanshi: one monitor, nothing to hotplug; sway's preferred mode at scale 1
# is right for the 24" 2560x1440 (122 dpi). Add an `output` line here if that
# changes. No battery-watch.

set $waybar_cfg desktop.jsonc
